## Code Example

```javascript
const lexicon = {
  "lol": "laughing out loud",
  "brb": "be right back",
  "tqm": "te quiero mucho"
};

function normalize(text, lang) {
  return text.replace(/\b(\w+)\b/g, (match) => {
    const key = match.toLowerCase();
    return lexicon[key] || match;
  });
}
```

